  "body": "## What changed\n\nMain now has the #3486 correction from PR #3505 (commit 835556814).\nThis PR merges upstream/main and keeps all checks from main.\nIt adds one explicit opening assertion to each of three multiaxis tests:\nthe first move must state the upright pose `Some([0.0, 0.0, 1.0])`.\nMain's lean checks and exact rapid inheritance checks stay.\nThe roughing test gets a name that describes its current checks.\nTwo stale comments (\"axis None\", \"Floors pose nothing\") now describe the upright floor pose.\nThe decision is in docs/decisions/3486-multiaxis-opening-pose-tests.md.\n\n## Cause\n\nPR #3421 states the upright pose before the first tilted feed.\nThe three tests expected no stated pose before that feed.\nPR #3505 corrected the inherited pose on main.\nThis PR adds the explicit check of the first move on top of that correction.\nNo production code changes.\n\n## Tests\n\nPins:\n- multiaxis::rapids_hold_the_pose_they_inherit\n- multiaxis_avoid::dodging_never_moves_the_ball\n- multiaxis_rough::rapids_hold_inherited_pose_and_flanks_lean\n\nThe roughing pin had the name rapids_and_floors_hold_no_pose_and_flanks_do.\n\nMutation check on the merged head 81008d26a:\nchange each opening assertion to expect `None`. All three pins fail with\n\"the opening states the upright pose\". Restore. All three pins pass.\n\nResults on head 81008d26a873f0aa4ecdf32558067e78401cd4ad, base upstream/main 6e641dac753020bfed49fec310237eed28448141:\n- cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main: green, four steps.\n- Full suites: multiaxis 7 passed, multiaxis_avoid 6 passed, multiaxis_rough 5 passed.\n- cargo clippy -p camcraft-motion --all-targets -- -D warnings: green.\n\nHeavy lanes (P2 report): cargo xtask gate heavy --base upstream/main on head 81008d26a:\n- heavy build (release --no-run): ok.\n- motion heavy: multiaxis: ok, 0 ignored tests ran (the binary has none).\n- motion heavy: multiaxis_avoid: ok, 0 ignored tests ran (the binary has none).\n- motion heavy: multiaxis_rough: ok, 0 ignored tests ran (the binary has none).\n- The gate selected no other lanes.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone. The .nc and .cl diff is empty.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nThe full batch gate was not run.\nThe change only adds test assertions and corrects comments.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nPR #3505 is merged and changed the same three tests. This PR merges it and keeps its checks.\n\nEffort: low\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #3486\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
